.env
**/.env
backups/
logs/
state/
.venv/
.git/
frontend/node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store

# NOTE: frontend/dist/ is intentionally NOT excluded here even though it is
# a build artifact directory: feishu-adapter/Dockerfile does
# `COPY frontend/dist /app/frontend-dist` from this same root build context,
# so excluding it would silently ship the adapter image without its
# dashboard assets (or fail the COPY outright). If this needs tightening,
# it has to be done with a build-specific ignore file (e.g. a BuildKit
# `feishu-adapter/Dockerfile.dockerignore`) that still allows frontend/dist,
# not a blanket rule here.
